From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Holland <samuel@sholland.org>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 13:24:53 +0900
Subject: riscv: add T-Head C906 cache and CPU support

Provide C906 cache operations and early ISA setup.
Keep the CPU startup state that the D1 firmware uses.

Link: https://github.com/smaeul/u-boot/tree/2e89b706f5c956a70c989cd31665f1429e9a0b48
Link: https://github.com/smaeul/u-boot/commit/a2615b3b161929df1ae151585d4638cc4ab09bf9
Signed-off-by: Samuel Holland <samuel@sholland.org>
Co-developed-by: khaliforce <kforce@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: khaliforce <kforce@gmail.com>
---
 arch/riscv/Kconfig             |  1 +
 arch/riscv/cpu/c906/Kconfig    |  5 +
 arch/riscv/cpu/c906/Makefile   |  3 +
 arch/riscv/cpu/c906/c906_csr.h | 15 ++
 arch/riscv/cpu/c906/cache.c    | 96 ++++++++++
 arch/riscv/cpu/c906/cpu.c      | 16 ++
 6 files changed, 136 insertions(+)

